# Copy to groups.txt (never committed), on the platform VM only, and list
# every group of the tournament, one per line:
#
#   name | public repository | tag | folder of the player in the repository
#
# The name is what the dashboard and the standings show. The folder is
# optional and defaults to `player`, as in the template. Use `.` when the
# repository has mix.exs at its root. `wikirace fetch` clones each group
# into deploy/final/groups/<name in lowercase, with _ for spaces>.

Los Cangrejos | https://github.com/someone/wiki_race.git | final
Mutex Maniacs | https://github.com/someone-else/crawler.git | final | .
